  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NMS-Fight against the Blasphemy law in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project Fight against the Blasphemy law through CLAAS Pakistan, is to raise a voice on behalf of the persecuted Christians in Pakistan, to promote basic human rights and freedom of religion or belief as described in the UN universal declaration of human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
